OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary school and 750 homes
OL,4,Aapproved near M5
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major new housing
OL,7,Fdevelopment close to a busy stretch of
OL,8,Fmotorway have been approved.
OL,10,FA primary school and 750 homes, along
OL,11,Fwith other facilities, will be built at
OL,12,Fthe site between Bower Lane and the M5
OL,13,Fin Bridgwater, Somerset.
OL,15,FSome local residents had raised
OL,16,Fconcerns over what they said were low
OL,17,Flevels of affordable housing included
OL,18,Fin the scheme and wanted to see more
OL,19,Fmoney contributed towards expanding the
OL,20,Fcapacity at NHS GP surgeries in the
OL,21,Ftown.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
